00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:46.339
So like 10 years ago or something, I went
to a podiatrist and the podiatrist said, Yup,

00:00:46.339 --> 00:00:49.280
your knees and ankles are not correctly aligned.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.609
