00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.560
So I do all the right things.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.560
I call my insurance.

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.860
I say, does my plan cover podiatry, David?

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.070
Yes, it does.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.070
Great.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.530
Uh, which podiatrists this my insurance cover.

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:08.530
Here's a list.

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.530
Great.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:13.810
Do I need a referral from my regular doctor
