00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.810
No, you don't.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:17.200
You just call the podiatrist and make an appointment.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.200
Fantastic.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.940
Do I need pre authorization from you, my insurance
