00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.340
Perfect.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.340
I make the appointment.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:33.380
I go, the doctor sees me for 10 minutes.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.380
Okay.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:39.890
10 minutes says, David, your arches are flat
so you need new insoles.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.670
We don't make insoles here.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:44.900
Here's a prescription for how the insole should
