00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.560
Go to this other place.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.340
The insurance is not going to cover the insoles.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:54.020
The insoles are going to be $375 but your
toes look fine.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.700
Nothing to worry about there with your Greek
feet.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.700
Perfect.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:02.290
I take my prescription, I pay my $40 copay
and I'm on my way.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:09.940
Two weeks go by and I get a bill for $414
