00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.599
are involved with this 10 minute specialist
visit.

00:05:14.599 --> 00:05:19.569
I spoke to one insurance person before making
the visit a appointment to figure out what

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:20.569
is and what isn't covered.

00:05:20.569 --> 00:05:24.330
I spoke to another insurance person after
I saw the doctor.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:29.469
I was then checked out at the office by someone
