00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.419
will go back and speak to the doctor and the
care supervisor.

00:05:38.419 --> 00:05:43.930
We're up to seven six people being spoken
to in seven different interactions and they

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:47.349
may end up rebilling this some other way.

00:05:47.349 --> 00:05:53.300
How much of the gap between the hundred dollars
this would have cost in other countries?

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:59.289
Maybe one 50 to the hundred to the eight 29
that in total I'm going to pay how much of

00:05:59.289 --> 00:06:05.309
that nearly $700 difference is related to
the fact that I spoke to six different people

00:06:05.309 --> 00:06:10.400
about billing related issues and again, I'm
lucky that this isn't serious and that I can

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.400
