00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:17.089
If I end up having no choice but to pay eight
29 total for this ridiculous fiasco, I'll

00:06:17.089 --> 00:06:19.180
be okay.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:24.180
That's not the case for a lot of people who
